## Python Instruction
Write a function to calculate the number of valid parentheses combinations given a number of pairs.

## Python Solution
```python
def num_combinations(n):
    dp = [0] * (n+1)
    dp[0] = 1
    for i in range(1, n+1):
        for j in range(i):
            dp[i] += dp[j] * dp[i-j-1]
    return dp[n]
```

## Python Tests
assert num_combinations(3) == 5
assert num_combinations(1) == 1
assert num_combinations(4) == 14

